; --- Second pass (38O). Budgeted rather than discovered: three cells in a row have needed one, so
; --- 38N2's retrospective named it the second half of the job. The first render put a wharf in the
; --- middle of 2,704 m² of bare mud with the whole east half empty. 39 more props, no new art — the
; --- road arrives through timber and carts, the south verge runs out into scrub, and the north
; --- shoulder hides the floor edge from the pier.

